mutation cache the next unissued event id
detects TypeOK
only one event
- /\ offer' = issued'
+ /\ offer' = issued' + 1

mutation leave a consumed beforeinstallprompt cached
detects OneUse
only one event
- ELSE /\ offer' = 0
+ ELSE /\ offer' = offer

mutation allow another visible control dispatch during an unresolved prompt
detects Guidance
only one event
-    /\ ~topDisabled
+    /\ TRUE

mutation allow the other button while the native prompt is open
detects ControlsLocked
only one event
- /\ topDisabled' = TRUE /\ inlineDisabled' = TRUE
+ /\ topDisabled' = TRUE /\ inlineDisabled' = FALSE

mutation keep the inline control disabled after a prompt exception
detects ControlsLocked
only one event
- /\ topDisabled' = FALSE /\ inlineDisabled' = FALSE
+ /\ topDisabled' = FALSE /\ inlineDisabled' = (result = "error")

mutation keep showing the inline invitation after install or standalone change
detects Visibility
only no event
- /\ inlineHidden' = topHidden'
+ /\ inlineHidden' = FALSE

mutation fail to hide the installation buttons on accepted choice
detects Visibility
only one event
- /\ installed' = (installed \/ result = "accepted")
+ /\ installed' = installed

mutation leave an already open guide visible when switching into standalone mode
detects GuideCurrent
only no event
- /\ guide' = IF hide THEN "closed" ELSE guide
+ /\ guide' = guide

mutation reopen the guide on a late rejected prompt after installation
detects GuideCurrent
only one event
- result = "error" /\ ~topHidden THEN "error"
+ result = "error" THEN "error"

mutation omit the manual guide when the browser has no event to offer
detects Guidance
only no event
- THEN /\ guide' = "manual"
+ THEN /\ guide' = "closed"

mutation silently swallow a prompt failure while both controls are visible
detects Guidance
only one event
- THEN "error" ELSE guide
+ THEN "closed" ELSE guide

mutation discard a new browser offer when an earlier installation attempt settles
detects LatestOffer
only two events
- /\ UNCHANGED <<issued,offer,spent,reused,standalone>>
+ /\ offer' = 0 /\ UNCHANGED <<issued,spent,reused,standalone>>
